  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehousing aid for Moroccan earthquake victims</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The most powerful seismic event to have shaken our country in over a century, the devastating magnitude 6.8 earthquake in southern Morocco on the night of Friday, September 8, 2023, whose epicenter was located in the province of Al-Haouz, southwest of Marrakech, which shook the entire nation and caused extensive human and material damage, resulting in a human tragedy. Millions of poor survivors urgently need help.</narrative>
  </description>
